<script src="/js/easy.js?version=545"></script><script src="/js/menu.js?version=545"></script><script src="/js/form.js?version=545"></script><script src="/js/inplace.js?version=545"></script><script>EC.version='545'</script></head>
<body><table class="page" id="page"><tr style="height:1px"><td><table class="header"><tr><td class="logocell"><a href="/" title="EasyChair home page"><img class="leftlogo" src="/images/logoEC_short.png"/></a></td><td class="rolecell">EasyChair Smart CFP</td><td style="width: 99%"></td><td class="helplink"><a class="toplinks" href="/docs/home" title="User guide">User guide</a></td></tr></table></td></tr><tr style="height:99%"><td class="menu_and_content"><div class="menu" id="menu0"><table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" class="menu" style="position:static; visibility:visible"><tr><td class="top" id="menu1" onclick="Menu.followLink2('menu1','/cfp',{&quot;a&quot;:null})" onmouseout="Menu.hide('menu1')" onmouseover="Menu.show('menu1')" title="Main page">Home</td><td class="top" id="menu2" onclick="Menu.followLink2('menu2','/cfp/choose',{})" onmouseout="Menu.hide('menu2')" onmouseover="Menu.show('menu2')" title="Create a new CFP">New CFP</td><td class="top" id="menu3" onclick="Menu.followLink2('menu3','/cfp/all',{})" onmouseout="Menu.hide('menu3')" onmouseover="Menu.show('menu3')" title="Manage my CFPs">My CFPs</td><td class="top" id="menu4" onclick="Menu.followLink2('menu4','/cfp/watchlist',{})" onmouseout="Menu.hide('menu4')" onmouseover="Menu.show('menu4')" title="My CFP watchlist">Watchlist</td></tr></table></div><div class="search_row" id="cfp:search:row"><form action="/cfp/search" id="search-form"><input id="search-input" name="query" placeholder="Search" type="text"/></form></div><div class="summary"><div class="pagetitle">CFP</div></div><div class="content" id="content"><div class="subcontent"><div id="cfp" style="clear:right"><table class="title_table"><tr><td class="logocell"><img src="/images/cfp-logo/meco2027.jpg?id=344643097"/></td><td class="titlecell"><div id="cfptitle">MECO 2027: 16th Mediterranean Conference on Embedded Computing</div><div id="cfpvenue">Akademija Znanja Budva</div><div id="cfpdateplace">Budva, Montenegro, June 8-11, 2027</div></td></tr></table><table class="date_table"><tr><td>Conference web page</td><td><a href="http://www.mecoconference.me/" target="_blank">http://www.mecoconference.me/</a></td></tr><tr><td>Submission link</td><td><a href="https://easychair.org/conferences/?conf=meco2027" target="_blank">https://easychair.org/conferences/?conf=meco2027</a></td></tr><tr><td>Poster</td><td><a href="/cfp/poster_download?cfp=344643097" onclick="return EC.linkClick(event)">(download)</a></td></tr><tr><td>Abstract registration deadline</td><td>March 30, 2027</td></tr><tr><td>Submission deadline</td><td>March 31, 2027</td></tr></table><div class="topics">Topics: <a href="/cfp/topic?tid=154661" onclick="return EC.linkClick(event)"><span class="tag fg_bluelight bg_aqua">cyber physical systems</span></a> <a href="/cfp/topic?tid=200145" onclick="return EC.linkClick(event)"><span class="tag fg_blue bg_fuchsia">internet of things</span></a> <a href="/cfp/topic?tid=670" onclick="return EC.linkClick(event)"><span class="tag fg_darkgreen bg_palegoldenrod">artificial intelligence</span></a> <a href="/cfp/topic?tid=26376519" onclick="return EC.linkClick(event)"><span class="tag fg_black bg_darksalmon">embedded systems and applications</span></a></div><p><a href="http://mecoconference.me/"><strong>MECO 2027 (16th Mediterranean Conference on Embedded Computing) </strong></a>is aproject of very successful events in embedded and general computing dated from 2012. It is an International Scientific Forum aimed to present and discussthe leading achievements in the modelling, analysis, design, validation andapplication of embedded computing systems, as well as, in the broader sense ofcomplete computer systems with applications and related fields. MECO is one ofthe most referenced conferences in Embedded Computing, Cyber-physicalSystems and Internet of Things. Moreover, MECO covers some other fieldsrelated to the computing and electrical engineering in general. MECO providesan opportunity for scientists, engineers, and researchers to discuss newapplications, design problems, ideas, solutions, research and developmentresults, experiences and work-in-progress in these important technologicalareas. MECO covers the theory, technology, design and applications of systemssupported by smart computers, such as embedded/cyber-physical systems andthe internet of things. With an excellent citation score and strong keynoteprogramme featuring outstanding, multidisciplinary speakers, including Nobellaureates, the conference has become a major event in the computing systemscalendar. MECO is a conference of highest scientific and professionalrecognition, <a href="https://mecoconference.me/quality-and-indexing/">INDEXED</a> in the distinguished Databases or Digital Libraries.SCOPUS, WoS, Microsoft Academic etc. The outstanding papers in extendedversion will be invited for publication in SCIE journals.</p><h2>Submission Guidelines</h2><p>All papers must be original and not simultaneously submitted to another journal or conference. The following paper categories are welcome:</p><ul><li><strong>Full papers</strong></li><li><strong>Demo papers (Design ideas)</strong></li><li><strong>Project disseminations</strong></li><li><strong>High-Tech Products/Services pressentation</strong></li><li><strong>Tutorials</strong></li><li><strong>Keynotes</strong></li></ul><p>More about <a href="https://mecoconference.me/meco-submissions/"><strong>Preparations and Submissions</strong></a></p><h2>List of Topics</h2><p>General Computing, Embedded Computing, Cyber Physical Systems, Internet of Things, Software for Embedded Systems, Algorithms, Programing, Systems on Chip (SoCs) and Multicore Systems Communications, Networking and Connectivity Sensors and Sensor Networks, Mobile and Pervasive/Ubiquitous Computing, Distributed Embedded Computing, Real-Time Systems, Reconfigurable Systems, Design Methodology and Tools, System Architecture, Synthesis, Ontology engineering, Multi-objective Optimization, Low-power Design and Energy Management Hardware/Software, Simulation,Rapid prototyping,Testing and Benchmarking, Micro and Nano Technology, Organic/Flexible/Printed Electronics, MEMS, VLSI Design and Implementation, Microcontrollers and FPGA, Real-Time Operating Systems, Cloud Computing, Digital Filter Design, Digital Signal Processing and Applications, Image and Multidimensional Signal Processing, Multimedia and Communications, Consumer Electronics, Wearable Health Care, Advanced signal processing, Electronics in Emergency and Disaster Management, Circuits and systems, Identification,  Industrial electronics, Bio-Medical circuits and systems, Automotive and Avionic Systems, Instrumentation and Measurement, Smart Systems, Embedded systems in Ecosystems, Precision agriculture etc...</p><h2>Committees</h2><h3><a href="https://mecoconference.me/meco2027/meco-committees/">Program Committee</a></h3><h3><a href="https://mecoconference.me/meco2027/meco-committees/">Organizing Committee</a></h3><h2>Invited Speakers</h2><p>MECO pays attention to the selection of Keynote speakers, with representation of experts from academia and industry. </p><p><a href="https://mecoconference.me/meco-cpsiot-2027-speakers/"><strong>MECO Keynote speakers</strong> </a>page</p><h2>Publication</h2><p>MECO 2027 proceedings will be published by IEEE.  </p><p>Previous <strong><a href="https://ieeexplore.ieee.org/xpl/conhome/1801788/all-proceedings">Proceedings in IEEE Xplore Digital Library </a></strong></p><h2>Venue</h2><p>The conference will be held in <strong><a href="https://en.wikivoyage.org/wiki/Budva">Budva</a>,</strong> <a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Montenegro"><strong>Montenegro</strong></a>, June 08th to 11th 2027. </p><h2>Contact</h2><p>All questions about submissions should be emailed to meco.conference@gmail.com or info@mecoconference.me</p><p>Conference website:<a href="https://mecoconference.me/"> https://mecoconference.me/ </a></p><p>IEEE Conference page: <a href="https://conferences.ieee.org/conferences_events/conferences/conferencedetails/58584">https://conferences.ieee.org/conferences_events/conferences/conferencedetails/58584</a></p><h2>Sponsors</h2><p><a href="https://ethw.org/IEEE_Serbia_and_Montenegro_Section_History">IEEE Serbia and Montenegro Section</a></p><p><a href="https://www.ucg.ac.me/">University of Montenegro</a></p><p><a href="http://www.mant.me/">Montenegrin Association for New Technologies (MANT)</a></p><p><a href="https://meconet.me/">Mediterranean Excellence in Computing and Ontology</a></p></div></div></div></td></tr><tr><td class="footer">Copyright © 2002 – 2026 EasyChair</td></tr></table></body></html>
